# Svenska (Swedish) language pack for MXBMRP3 - BETA.
# Drafted for 1.35; not yet reviewed line by line by a native speaker.
# Corrections are welcome: see README.md in the parent folder.
#
# Glossary (keep these consistent):
#   rider = förare, bike = hoj, lap = varv, sector = sektor, split = mellantid,
#   gap = gap, PB = PB / personbästa, standings = ställning, pits = depå,
#   penalty = straff, session = session, practice = träning, qualify = kval,
#   race = lopp, settings = inställningar, hotkeys = genvägar, rumble = vibration,
#   toast/notice = notis, achievement = utmärkelse, profile = profil,
#   On/Off = På/Av, Default = Standard, Auto = Auto.
#   Kept in English as players say them: HUD, Dash, holeshot, whip, scrub,
#   oppo, endo, stoppie, wheelie, backflip, frontflip, turn down, FMX, OBS.
